## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- Detect opening bar: on each H1 bar, check `iTime(NULL,PERIOD_H1,0) == session_open_time`
  where `session_open_time` is a time constant (e.g., 08:00 GMT → convert to broker time)
- Store `bracket_high = iHigh(H1,0); bracket_low = iLow(H1,0)` once at opening bar
- Place BUYSTOP and SELLSTOP as pending orders immediately
- OCO: on OrderFill, loop pending orders and delete opposite
- Bracket filter: `if (bracket_high - bracket_low > 60 * pip_size) skip;`
- EOD cancel: `if (TimeCurrent() > eod_time) { close all; cancel pending; }`
- P3 sweeps: session open (London/NY/both), ATR TP (1.0/1.5/2.0), bracket cap (40/60/80 pips)

